---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy — Transit411">
  <div class="page">
    <h1 class="disp">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lede">Plain and short: we collect the minimum we need to run Transit411, we don't sell your data, and you can opt out anytime.</p>

    <h2 class="disp">What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Newsletter email</strong> — if you subscribe, we store your email address to send the newsletter.</li>
      <li><strong>Basic usage data</strong> — standard, largely anonymous analytics and server logs (pages viewed, general location, device type) to understand what's useful and keep the site secure.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="disp">How we use it</h2>
    <p>To deliver the newsletter you asked for, to operate and improve the site, and to keep it secure. That's it.</p>

    <h2 class="disp">Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share data only with the service providers that help us run Transit411 (for example, email delivery and hosting), and only as needed to provide the service, or when required by law.</p>

    <h2 class="disp">Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use only the cookies needed to run the site and understand aggregate usage. We don't use them to build advertising profiles.</p>

    <h2 class="disp">Your choices</h2>
    <p>Every newsletter includes an unsubscribe link. To access or delete information we hold about you, email us and we'll take care of it.</p>

    <h2 class="disp">Contact</h2>
    <p>Transit411 is operated by Shepherd Labs, LLC. Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:hello@transit411.net">hello@transit411.net</a>.</p>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: 2026.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
